`

text(local) SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_AndreaIntro {
	"I'll show you the sublime techniques\n"
	"I learned from our Leader Juan!"
}

text(local) SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_AndreaDefeat {
	"Please forgive me, Juan\."
}

text(local) SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_AndreaPostBattle {
	"Watch what happens if you crack all\n"
	"the floor tiles."
}

text(local) SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_CrissyIntro {
	"You came all the way here, but you won't\n"
	"get to see Juan.\p"
	"Not if you lose to me, you won't!"
}

text(local) SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_CrissyDefeat {
	"You're strong!\n"
	"I was fooled by your cute looks!"
}

text(local) SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_CrissyPostBattle {
	"You might be good enough to avoid\n"
	"being wiped out in one hit by Juan."
}

text(local) SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_DaphneIntro {
	"The sight of Juna conducting\n"
	"a battle\.\p"
	"The very beauty of it compelled me to\n"
	"become a Trainer.$"
}

text(local) SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_DaphneDefeat {
	"You battled with more beauty than\n"
	"I could muster\."
}

text(local) SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_DaphnePostBattle {
	"The grace you bring to battle is\n"
	"fabulous.\p"
	"Oh\. I'm so fortunate to have found\n"
	"Pok\emon.$"
}

text(local) SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_ConnieIntro {
	"I should teach you how harsh battles\n"
	"can be."
}

text(local) SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_ConnieDefeat {
	"Oh.\n"
	"You're strong."
}

text(local) SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_ConniePostBattle {
	"I'll tell you something good.\p"
	"If you want to reach Juan, you\n"
	"need to walk on each floor tile once."
}

text(local) SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BridgetIntro {
	"The Pok\emon Gym of the highest level\n"
	"in the Hoenn region\.\p"
	"That's the Sootopolis Gym."
}

text(local) SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BridgetDefeat {
	"What a high level you are!"
}

text(local) SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BridgetPostBattle {
    "Rather than being satisfied by being\n"
	"in a strong Gym, I imagine training in\l"
	"other places will make you stronger.\l"
	"But above all, it looks more fun."
}

text(local) SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_OliviaIntro {
	"I train my Pok\emon together with\n"
	"Juan.\p"
	"Don't think I'm a pushover."
}

text(local) SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_OliviaDefeat {
	"I was beaten\."
}

text(local) SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_OliviaPostBattle {
	"I think you have potential.\n"
	"Why don't you stay and train with us?"
}

text(local) SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_TiffanyIntro {
	"A graceful glide across the ice while\n"
	"crossing no lines…\p"
	"A Trainer putting on that performance\n"
	"would be elegantly beautiful!"
}

text(local) SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_TiffanyDefeat {
	"Well, excuse me?!"
}

text(local) SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_TiffanyPostBattle {
	"This is really obvious, but how strong\n"
	"you are as a Trainer has nothing to do\l"
	"with how young or old you are."
}

text(local) SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BethanyIntro {
	"When I'm with my Pok\emon, the time\n"
	"flies by before you can say, \qoOops!\qc"
}

text(local) SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BethanyDefeat {
	"Oops!"
}

text(local) SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BethanyPostBattle {
	"I wish I could forget about lost causes\n"
	"before I can manage an \qoOops!\qc"
}

text(local) SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_AnnikaIntro {
	"I can battle with really rare Pok\emon\n"
	"if you'd like."
}

text(local) SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_AnnikaDefeat {
	"Oh, there now! Did you have a good look\n"
	"at my Pok\emon?"
}

text(local) SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_AnnikaPostBattle {
	"I came to this Gym because Juan\n"
	"praised me for my darling Pok\emon.\p"
	"Oh, if only I'd met Juan years ago\n"
	"when I was younger\."
}

text(local) SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BriannaIntro {
	"Giggle\.\n"
	"Your grim look is so charming."
}

text(local) SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BriannaDefeat {
	"Oh, dear.\n"
	"I went much too easy on you."
}

text(local) SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BriannaPostBattle {
	"You couldn't lay a finger on Juan,\n"
	"I'm sure. Giggle\.-"
}